# Scene 8: The veteran's worry. The courtyard, evening. Si Hédi and Aziz.
# Trade-off vote, paid off in scenes 9 and 10.
# Si Hédi's court story is fictionalised from 2026.

~ start
Aziz: Si Hédi, if I catch someone with a phone and the father says I lied... what happens to me?
Si Hédi: [#worried] Last year a colleague reported a device and ended up in court. Teachers wore red armbands for him.
Si Hédi: [#worried] (To you.) You want us to report everything. Then plan for what happens to us when we do.
M. Jlassi: (Phone.) Also, the region has some budget for anti-cheating equipment, if you'd rather. Very modern.
do Story.show_card(9)
What does your staffing plan add?
- Anti-cheating equipment for every room, from the region's budget.
	do GameState.record_vote(8, "A")
	do GameState.budget -= 1500
	do GameState.set_flag("bought_tech")
	M. Jlassi: Excellent, the boxes arrive Monday.
	Si Hédi: Boxes don't supervise.
- Training for every supervisor on spotting devices, the week before.
	do GameState.record_vote(8, "B")
	do GameState.team += 5
	do GameState.integrity += 10
	do GameState.budget -= 300
	do GameState.set_flag("staff_trained")
	Aziz: Training! I'll take notes on my notes.
- A written reporting procedure, with legal backing for supervisors.
	do GameState.record_vote(8, "C")
	do GameState.team += 15
	do GameState.set_flag("staff_protected")
	Si Hédi: Now I'll report.
	Aziz looks relieved.
=> END
